<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher in active trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 590.79, up 0.31.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 264 to 248.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.01.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 21,403,705, compared with 20,186,915 Monday.</p>
<p>	  (Prices official as of 1330 EST/1830 GMT)</p>
</text>
